      "content": "It sounds like you're feeling overwhelmed and exhausted, both physically and emotionally, from the responsibilities of caregiving. Your sense of identity and purpose may be tied to this role, leaving you feeling lost and unmoored once it's gone. It's completely normal to feel like you're already moving on to a new stage of life, even if it hasn't happened yet. Consider reaching out to a support group or therapist to work through these feelings.",
